#title: BT-196(BT-142)-LotResult
#description: The corresponding XML element is /*/ext:UBLExtensions/ext:UBLExtension/ext:ExtensionContent/efext:EformsExtension/efac:NoticeResult/efac:LotResult/efac:FieldsPrivacy[efbc:FieldIdentifierCode/text()='win-cho']/efbc:ReasonDescription. 
#xpath: /*/ext:UBLExtensions/ext:UBLExtension/ext:ExtensionContent/efext:EformsExtension/efac:NoticeResult/efac:LotResult/efac:FieldsPrivacy[efbc:FieldIdentifierCode/text()='win-cho']/efbc:ReasonDescription

